  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Our brand specializes in stunning tees and clothing designs for basketball fans and players alike. We started as an Instagram reels channel (@clapper.clips) and are determined to bring communities like ours quality clothing that you can rock on and off the court.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br>&bull; Product description:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We have various designs and tees on our store, highlighting the numbers, legacies, and careers of various specific basketball players.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Our designs are unique and we pride ourselves with the ability to provide quality. If you are interested, feel free to DM @clapper.clips or @clapper.crafts on instagram; we can create a unique or special design to fit your channel/forms of advertisement.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br>&bull; Payment terms:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We pay 20% commission on most our sales, which is significantly higher than a lot of different sites.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br>&bull; Other information:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">The team here is looking forward to working with you! Let's get started -- our success is also your success!</p>",
